        Paragraph(Text("A diagonal vertex of a shuffle is an interior corner: deleting it merges unlike steps and increases both coordinates. A left vertex has the complementary first-coordinate behavior; a right vertex has the second-coordinate behavior. Endpoints are included through the explicit endpoint clauses in these predicates.")),
